PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Smooth Side
    - Two distinct smooth maps f ≠ g between manifolds M → N
    - Drawn as two separate curved arrows
  L2: Discrete Side
    - Graph F(M) → F(N)
    - Single arrow representing F(f) = F(g)
  L3: Functor Arrow
    - Horizontal arrow labeled "F"
  L4: Labels
    - "Non-Faithful"
    - "f ≠ g but F(f) = F(g)"
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Highlight: collapse of morphism distinction

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
